      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRACE ILE (6) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 25.32 beating Devenish Devil. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Hard to fault her recent form and can win again. NANGAR NUGGET (5) is an honest type in the frame at five of 17 starts including 10 wins, the latest scoring (21.80) over 390m at this track. Is yet to taste defeat at this course and distance. Rates a winning chance on best. PARTY WITH TOM (1) has a strong record this trip with six wins and four placings from 16 starts. Recorded a 5 length win (21.75) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. MR. LASSO (4) comes off a (21.59) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 390m at this track. Has four wins already from this draw.",
